"I was holding his hand while he stopped breathing and only after he stopped breathing and passed away I accepted him for the first time that he was not invincible," he said.
Daley's next year competed at the 2012 Olympics and won the bronze medal.
“I knew that’s what I’d dreamed about all my live — diving in front of the local public at the Olympic Games, there was no more beautiful feeling,” he said.
Also, this inspired his first musical selection — Proud by Heather Small — having accompanied him during preparations for the Olympic Games and continues to cause mornica.
